&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ever imagined saying, “I helped launch the future of transportation”?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rewriting the rules of urban mobility. At Vay, customers tap a button and a car arrives - with no one inside - powered by our world-first Remote Driving technology on real public streets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re live in Las Vegas and scaling fast, powered by a strategic investment of up to $410 million from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.grab.com/sg/&quot;&gt;Grab&lt;/a&gt;. Our mission is simple: replace private car ownership with a faster, cleaner, door-to-door mobility model. If you want to build something real, visible, and genuinely transformative, you’ll feel right at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious to experience Vay yourself? Use the code &lt;em data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;VAYCANDIDATE&lt;/em&gt; for $10 off your first trip in Las Vegas! Download the &quot;Vay&quot; app from the Apple or Google Play store &amp;amp; off you go!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s happening at Vay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First to roll out vehicles in both Europe and the USA on public roads without a human being inside &amp;amp; currently the 2nd largest commercial, driverless car fleet in the Western World.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;ve partnered with &lt;a href=&quot;https://kodiak.ai/&quot;&gt;Kodiak&lt;/a&gt; to bring remote-driving technology to autonomous trucks in the US, showcasing our ability to integrate our system into heavy-duty commercial vehicles and expand the applications of our tech across the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ve completed 10’s of thousands of trips so far and are busy multiplying our Las Vegas fleet just to meet demand!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;...And soon we’ll be expanding across the US &amp;amp; Europe 🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is exciting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Security at Vay is different. You’ll be working across a real-world technology platform combining vehicles, embedded systems, software, cloud infrastructure, connectivity and Remote Driving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior / Principal Security Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll help shape the cybersecurity foundation of our technology platform, influencing architecture, engineering decisions and security practices across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who can operate strategically while staying technically hands-on. Depending on your experience and scope of ownership, the role can be hired at either Senior or Principal level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be driving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve cybersecurity engineering practices across Vay’s Remote Driving platform and vehicle ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform threat modelling, security risk assessments and technical security analysis across products and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define cybersecurity requirements and work with engineering teams to implement practical mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence architecture and system design across Software, Systems, Embedded, Infrastructure, Safety and Validation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build security into the full engineering lifecycle, from early design through implementation, testing and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape security testing and validation strategies across Vay’s technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support secure approaches to authentication, authorization, communications, software updates, identity and trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess vulnerabilities, prioritize real-world risk and drive effective remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent cybersecurity in technical reviews, architecture discussions and internal and external conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable security processes that can support the continued growth of Vay’s commercial fleet and technology platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This might be a great fit, if&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around &lt;strong&gt;8+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; across cybersecurity engineering, product security, application security, platform security or related areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of security architecture, secure software development, threat modelling, vulnerability management and security risk assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing complex products involving multiple software, infrastructure, networking, hardware or device components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating security risks into clear technical requirements and practical mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of authentication, authorization, cryptography, secure communications and trust models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with security standards, regulatory frameworks or structured cybersecurity engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical depth and the ability to understand unfamiliar systems quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills across technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning ambiguous problems and operating both strategically and hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For &lt;strong&gt;Principal-level scope&lt;/strong&gt;, significant experience driving security architecture, technical direction and cybersecurity topics across multiple engineering teams or an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing embedded systems, firmware, robotics, IoT, industrial technology, aerospace, medical devices, automotive systems or other cyber-physical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automotive cybersecurity or vehicle systems security experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;ISO 21434, UNECE R155/R156, IEC 62443, the Cyber Resilience Act (CRA)&lt;/strong&gt; or similar standards and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting &lt;strong&gt;TARA&lt;/strong&gt; or comparable structured security risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of embedded Linux, secure boot, secure software updates, hardware-backed security or device lifecycle security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why choose Vay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪 A global team of smart, motivated people from 30+ countries who love tackling hard problems and turning bold ideas into reality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Huge scope for impact in a fast paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 EIP stock options: A stake in Vay’s future - not just a salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Unlimited Paid Vacation Days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎫 Subsidised Deutschland ticket (Berlin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏋️‍♂️ Subsidised Urban Sports Club or FitX Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 All Vay team members receive 30% off their Vay rides&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛍️ Exclusive external discounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 €350 Home Office Set-up&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Relocation financial assistance when relocating to Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Fully funded German Lessons&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎊 Regular team events throughout the year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;For more information on Vay’s physical demands, working environments and safety requirements, you can review this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1swEohclBwsOgx37G4NHE2szYCA6avS_aQX_WSJ7Ih8k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.6dlrur2mwcd9&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;. We’ll also cover anything specific to this role during the first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We’d love to stay connected for future opportunities, so feel free to include your LinkedIn profile when you apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds and experiences. If you’re excited about shaping something truly groundbreaking, we’d be happy to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;job-modal__content-heading&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The (Senior) Category Manager Marketing will be responsible for overseeing strategic sourcing and contracting at HelloFresh for Marketing across different marketing categories, which may include: Offline Media, Online Media, Influencer Marketing, Sponsorships, Retail Media, etc. The goal is to collaborate seamlessly with Global and regional stakeholders and major suppliers in all HelloFresh markets and help them to navigate the procurement landscape. In addition, the role will be supporting initiatives targeted to increase the maturity level of Indirect Procurement’s processes and systems landscape. As part of the Marketing&amp;nbsp; Procurement team the position will report to the respective lead based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, confident, proactive and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for prioritisation, data handling and great stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4-5 years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director for Lifecycle, CC Outbound, owns the outbound call center channel strategy and performance for millions of former customers across all 17 of our international markets and all our brands. We are looking for a CRM expert, who is interested in running strategy for Call Center, with a high level of autonomy and agility. You will own the strategic development, performance and strategic innovations for this channel, working closely with the Call Center Operations team. Your scope includes steering performance and managing budgets, implementing strategies that will unlock a better customer experience, under consideration of country-specific idiosyncrasies. It also means developing this channel into one of our prime sources of insight to customer sentiment and inspiration for product improvements at scale (e.g., through the use of AI tools). Moreover, you will own the performance of this channel, which includes setting targets together with our local market CMOs and day-to-day steering of conversions, cost and ROI together with our VP of customer care and his operations managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to own a critical channel for one of our most valuable customer groups and develop a strong muscle in driving CRM strategy and execution, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM Strategy Development:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement annual strategic plans for Call Centre Outbound initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the CC Outbound for the full customer lifecycle, from leads to reactivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with CC Operations, cross-functional teams, local markets and international marketing leadership to align strategies with overall business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalization of Customer Interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with L&amp;amp;D, Brand and local teams to enrich the training for agents, adding the local context, address the customer needs and have the best pitch for the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test personalized offers for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI tools to improve customer interactions and call content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call Centre Outbound Campaign Management:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute outbound communication campaigns. Provide guidance on campaign targeting, messaging, incentives and timing to maximize conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and steer campaign performance, maximizing ROI and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all outbound communication activities comply with relevant regulations and internal expectations (e.g., via quality assurance measures)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Analysis and Tech Tooling:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analysis to identify, test and evaluate impactful reactivation strategies and improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and implement CRM tools to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of outbound initiatives, coordinating with Call Center Operations and CommsTech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in and a passion for delivering excellent and effective customer experiences (e.g., working in CRM/Lifecycle Marketing, campaign management, Product, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with an ability to influence and motivate people at all levels within international environments and across a broad variety of job functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mentality and drive to deliver results, including experience with prioritizing for highest impact and managing trade-off decisions in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to derive actionable insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally hands-on experience working with or in Call Centres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally experience in Experimentation/Testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
